<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>管理员登录 - <%= siteName %></title><link rel="icon" href="<%= siteIcon || defaultSiteIcon %>"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/styles.css"></head>
<body class="center-page" style="--questra-theme-color:<%= themeColor || '#0D9488' %>"><main class="message-box"><span class="brand-mark<%= siteIconAsInitial ? ' image' : '' %>" style="background:<%= siteInitialColor || '#0D9488' %>"><% if (siteIconAsInitial) { %><img src="<%= siteIcon || defaultSiteIcon %>" alt=""><% } else { %><%= Array.from(siteInitial || siteName || 'Questra')[0] %><% } %></span><h1>需要 Admin Token</h1><p>请使用启动日志中打印的管理地址访问，或在请求中携带 <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code>。</p></main></body></html>
